<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's MetLife cuts voting stake in MLGL.</title>
<headline>NZ's MetLife cuts voting stake in MLGL.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metropolitan Life Assurance Company of New Zealand Limited said on Friday it had cut its stake in the relevant voting shares of private healthcare services group Metropolitan Lifecare Group Limited (MLGL) to 14.4 percent from 26.8 percent.</p>
<p>The change followed a reduction in the number of voting shares in MLGL held by the institution to 8.17 million from 15.25 million, MetLife said in a statement to the New Zealand Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>It gave no other details of any underlying transactions.</p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom +64 4 471 4273</p>
</text>
